to be. Here's what's actually happening

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:19.359
in your brain during flow. And it's an

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:21.440
incredible state to be in your

00:04:19.359 --> 00:04:23.199
prefrontal cortex, which is the part of

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.960
your brain right behind your forehead

