00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:02.479
Something most people get wrong about

00:08:00.479 --> 00:08:04.720
flow is they think it's something you

00:08:02.479 --> 00:08:06.800
just fall into. Like you sit down and

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:09.199
boom, you're in the zone. That is not

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:11.360
how it works. Flow actually has four

00:08:09.199 --> 00:08:12.960
stages. And the first stage is struggle.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:14.960
So think of this as the loading screen

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:16.800
phase. You sit down, the work feels

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:18.160
hard, you're frustrated, your brain

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:19.840
feels like it's walking through mud.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:20.960
It's terrible. Most people quit here

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:22.639
because they think this isn't working

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:25.759
out. I should just go do something else.

00:08:22.639 --> 00:08:27.280
But this stage is stage one essential.

00:08:25.759 --> 00:08:28.879
Your brain is literally loading

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:30.560
information and processing the problem,

00:08:28.879 --> 00:08:32.159
which is why it feels difficult. And if

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:34.320
you skip the struggle, you will never

00:08:32.159 --> 00:08:36.719
reach flow. So when the first 10 to 15

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:38.479
minutes feel terrible for you, I promise

00:08:36.719 --> 00:08:40.719
you the struggle will end if you

00:08:38.479 --> 00:08:43.680
continue to stick with it. It always

00:08:40.719 --> 00:08:45.519
ends. So don't give up. Stage two is

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:47.600
release. This is where you take your

00:08:45.519 --> 00:08:49.120
hands off the problem. You go for a

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:50.880
walk. You take a shower. Go do something

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:53.200
that doesn't require intense focus. And

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:54.560
what's happening is your conscious mind

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:56.480
releases the problem so your

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:58.080
subconscious can start working on it.

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:59.360
This is why you get your best ideas in

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:01.360
the shower because your brain was

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:03.839
actually still working on it the whole

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:04.959
time. but you just needed to get out of

00:09:03.839 --> 00:09:07.279
his way. And guys, I'm feeling kind of

00:09:04.959 --> 00:09:09.279
silly today. I'm flowing. So, stage

00:09:07.279 --> 00:09:11.279
three is getting into flow itself. You

00:09:09.279 --> 00:09:12.880
drop in, everything clicks, action and

00:09:11.279 --> 00:09:14.720
awareness merge, you stop thinking about

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:16.720
doing the task, and you just do it. And

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:19.200
sometimes, if you're in a dedicated

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:20.800
enough environment where there are no

