everything else, here's the actual most

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.639
practical part of this video. If some of

00:13:11.519 --> 00:13:13.920
you guys are like blah blah blah blah,

00:13:12.639 --> 00:13:16.000
let's just get into it. Well, here it

