00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:19.920
something mindless for about 30 minutes.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:21.279
And then if you have the energy, you can

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:22.800
do another block. But we don't have to

00:15:21.279 --> 00:15:24.880
force it. I also want to talk

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:26.320
specifically about creative flow because

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:28.720
most flow advice is all about

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:30.560
