You can edit it later. Flow requires

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:45.920
that your prefrontal cortex deactivates

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:47.440
and [music] your cortex is where

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:49.040
perfectionism lives. So, you literally

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:50.800
cannot be in flow state and be perfect

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:52.320
at the same time. They are mutually

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:54.639
exclusive and it is impossible to

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:56.959
combine the two. So give yourself the

00:16:54.639 --> 00:16:59.120
permission to be messy. That's where all

00:16:56.959 --> 00:17:00.720
the magic actually happens. So here's

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.320
what actually make this whole thing like

